%N A399218 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} AO(k)/k^2, where AO(k) = A007509(k)/A352395(k) is the k-th alternating odd harmonic number (or skew-harmonic number of the second kind).
%H A399218 Chunli Li and Wenchang Chu, <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/math12040589">Evaluating infinite series involving harmonic numbers by integration</a>, Mathematics, Vol. 12, No. 4 (2024), Article 589. See Theorem 7, p. 15.
%H A399218 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%F A399218 Equals Pi*W/4 + Pi^3/16 - 2*G*log(2), where W = A399217, and G is Catalan's constant (A006752).
%e A399218 1.48329662211912418720111168380925356646597810406900006...
%t A399218 RealDigits[HypergeometricPFQ[{1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, {1, 3/2, 3/2}, 1] * Pi/4 + Pi^3/16 - 2*Catalan*Log[2], 10, 120][[1]]
%o A399218 (PARI) hypergeom([1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2], [1,3/2,3/2], 1) * Pi/4 + Pi^3/16 - 2*Catalan*log(2)
